{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_tech_stack_tech_stack", "label": "Tech Stack Decision Record", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_react_native_client", "label": "React Native (Expo) Mobile Client Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Web/PWA ruled out because mobile browsers suspend microphone capture on background/lock, conflicting with P0-2's interruption-survival requirement. React Native over two native codebases because a lean 4-8 week MVP team cannot maintain separate Swift and Kotlin apps."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_expo_custom_dev_client", "label": "Expo Custom Dev Client (CNG) Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Background audio capture needs native modules (background task registration, foreground service on Android, AVAudioSession background mode on iOS) that plain Expo managed workflow doesn't expose; a custom dev client keeps EAS Build/OTA while allowing native modules."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_fastapi_backend", "label": "FastAPI Python Backend Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend is mostly I/O orchestration; every vendor (ElevenLabs, OpenAI-compatible note-gen, Anthropic fallback) ships a first-class Python SDK. FastAPI's free OpenAPI schema lets the RN client generate a typed API client, recovering the type-sharing benefit without forcing Python on mobile. Pydantic models double as validation for the note state machine and consent ledger schema."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_postgresql_database", "label": "PostgreSQL Database Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data is relational by nature (patients, encounters, consent-ledger, notes, revisions, audit logs with real FKs). Postgres enum types enforce the note state machine at the DB layer; pgcrypto gives field-level PHI encryption without a separate KMS service; REVOKE UPDATE/DELETE plus an INSERT-only role gives an actually-enforced append-only consent ledger."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_object_storage_minio_s3", "label": "S3-Compatible Object Storage Decision (MinIO/S3)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Audio/transcripts are blobs, not rows; server-side encryption is separate from Postgres-level pgcrypto. MinIO locally is bit-for-bit API compatible with the prod S3-compatible bucket so no code branches on environment. Retention is a bucket lifecycle policy plus a retention_expires_at column, not a hardcoded TTL."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_celery_redis_pipeline", "label": "Celery + Redis Async Pipeline Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Transcription and note generation are slow, external, and retryable \u2014 Celery's use case. Redis is both the Celery broker and the patient fuzzy-match cache. The pipeline is a Celery chain (upload_finalized to transcribe to generate_note to notify_client) with an idempotency key stored as a unique constraint on the pipeline-run row, so a retried upload chunk resolves to the same run."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_note_generator_provider_interface", "label": "NoteGenerator Provider Interface Pattern", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A small provider interface (NoteGenerator.generate(transcript) -> Note) with two implementations (Luna, Haiku) selected by a config flag makes the Claude Haiku 4.5 fallback a one-line config change instead of a code change, per the roadmap's own mitigation for the no-bake-off risk."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_auth_security_baseline", "label": "Auth & Security Baseline Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JWT access/refresh tokens with password + TOTP MFA (pyotp) instead of SMS OTP, since Remedy is not a telco and SMS delivery in the Philippines is a needless external dependency and cost. Role field checked via a FastAPI dependency on every route for need-to-know RBAC. A single audit_log table written by middleware, not scattered per-endpoint logging."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_vendor_integrations", "label": "Vendor Integrations (ElevenLabs Scribe v2, GPT-5.6 Luna, Claude Haiku 4.5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_monorepo_layout", "label": "Monorepo Repo Layout Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A monorepo, not separate repos for mobile/api, because the two halves ship together at every milestone in the roadmap (Week 1 core pipeline, Week 2 identity+review+signing) \u2014 separate repos would add coordination overhead for a lean team with no other consumers of either half."}, {"id": "docs_tech_stack_deferred_items", "label": "Deliberately Deferred Items (KMS, managed MQ, multi-tenant)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_tech_stack_tech_stack", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_prd", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_tech_stack", "target": "remedy_scribe_roadmap_roadmap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_react_native_client", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_offline_first_capture", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_expo_custom_dev_client", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_offline_first_capture", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_expo_custom_dev_client", "target": "apps_mobile_agents_agents", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_fastapi_backend", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_review_edit_signing", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_postgresql_database", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_review_edit_signing", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_postgresql_database", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_patient_identity_linking", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_postgresql_database", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_consent_gated_recording", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_postgresql_database", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_security_baseline", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_object_storage_minio_s3", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_offline_first_capture", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_celery_redis_pipeline", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_asr_transcription", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_celery_redis_pipeline", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_ai_note_generation", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_celery_redis_pipeline", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_offline_first_capture", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_note_generator_provider_interface", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_ai_note_generation", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_auth_security_baseline", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_security_baseline", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_monorepo_layout", "target": "remedy_scribe_roadmap_roadmap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_vendor_integrations", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_asr_transcription", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_vendor_integrations", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_ai_note_generation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tech_stack_deferred_items", "target": "remedy_scribe_prd_non_goals", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "p0_security_baseline_stack", "label": "P0-8 Security Baseline Implementation Stack", "nodes": ["docs_tech_stack_auth_security_baseline", "apps_api_requirements_python_jose", "apps_api_requirements_passlib", "apps_api_requirements_bcrypt", "apps_api_requirements_pyotp", "remedy_scribe_prd_security_baseline"], "relation": "implement", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md"}, {"id": "async_note_pipeline_chain", "label": "Celery Async Transcription-to-Note Pipeline Chain", "nodes": ["docs_tech_stack_celery_redis_pipeline", "docs_tech_stack_note_generator_provider_interface", "remedy_scribe_prd_asr_transcription", "remedy_scribe_prd_ai_note_generation", "remedy_scribe_roadmap_vendor_bakeoff_risk"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/tech-stack.md"}]}